[center][size=5][b]Reduced Pulse Engine Fuel Costs[/b][/size]
Scale fuel usage by Half, Quater or Tenth.[/center]

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies [i]METADATA/REALITY/TABLES/NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE[/i]. It may conflict
with any other mod editing that file[/*]
[*]Built for Cosmos v7.04[/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/reduced-pulse-engine-fuel-costs]https://github.com/SavageCore/reduced-pulse-drive-engine-costs[/url]